<dict>
	<key>WFWorkflowActions</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.comment</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>📋 开始录屏</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.comment</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>• • 等待 3 秒倒计时</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.comment</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>• • 启动屏幕录制</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.comment</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>• • 显示悬浮按钮</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.comment</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>在快捷指令 App 中手动创建此快捷指令，按上述步骤添加操作。</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.showresult</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFTextActionText</key>
				<string>✅ 快捷指令设计完成！

请在快捷指令 App 中手动创建：
1. 打开「快捷指令」App
2. 点击 + 新建快捷指令
3. 按上方步骤逐一添加操作
4. 完成后命名保存</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.gettext</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFTextActionText</key>
				<string>屏幕录制即将开始...
3 秒后自动启动</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.showresult</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFTextActionText</key>
				<string></string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
